	<article id="post-12962" class="post-12962 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-engelliweb tag-8-a">
	<header class="entry-header entry-header--document">
		<div class="entry-header-inner">
			<h1 class="entry-title">Türkiye İşçi Partisi’nin X hesabı</h1>
							<p class="entry-published">
					<span class="screen-reader-text">Yayımlanma tarihi: </span>
					<time datetime="2026-10-14T10:55:24+03:00">14 Ekim 2026</time>
				</p>
					</div>
	</header>
		<div class="entry-content">
		
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Türkiye İşçi Partisi</strong>’nin 582 bin takipçili X hesabı (@tipgenelmerkez), 5651 sayılı Kanun’un 8/A maddesi kapsamında erişime engellendi. Hesap, X tarafından henüz Türkiye’den görünmez kılınmadı.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1600" height="900" src="https://ifade.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_TIP_8A.png" alt="" class="wp-image-12963" srcset="https://ifade.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_TIP_8A.png 1600w, https://ifade.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_TIP_8A-768x432.png 768w, https://ifade.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_TIP_8A-384x216.png 384w, https://ifade.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_TIP_8A-720x405.png 720w, https://ifade.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_TIP_8A-900x506.png 900w, https://ifade.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_TIP_8A-1536x864.png 1536w, https://ifade.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_TIP_8A-640x360.png 640w, https://ifade.org.tr/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014_TIP_8A-1280x720.png 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" /></figure>
	</div>
</article>

